92186422478 1069 "q-131649" 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422478 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422478 1071 "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-2x+2y-4z=4 \\\\ -x+y-2z=2 \\\\ x-y+2z=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422478 1072 #uuid "86e15f08-648b-5bcc-988f-7551732eb466" 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422478 1074 "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & -4 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & -4 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & ↔{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -4 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -4 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-y+2z=-2 \\\\ 0x+0y+0z=0 \\\\ 0x+0y+0z=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince any numbers $x,y,z$ form a solution of the final two equations, we can remove these equations from the system. \n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x$, and we have two free variables, $y,$ and $z.$ That means we need to find $x$ in terms of $y$ and $z.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=y-2z-2 \\\\ y=y \\\\ z=z,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ and $z$ (the free variables) are arbitrary numbers.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}y-2z-2 \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422479 1068 #edb/ref 17592186422477 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422479 1069 "q-74621" 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422479 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422479 1071 "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4x-11y+5z=-1 \\\\ x-3y+2z=1 \\\\ -3x+9y-6z=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form." 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422479 1072 #uuid "df6c8a6d-153a-5484-848d-1043ee95c582" 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422479 1074 "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -11 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 9 & -6 & -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}4 & -11 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 9 & -6 & -3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & ↔{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -11 & 5 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 9 & -6 & -3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-4){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ -3 & 9 & -6 & -3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the row echelon form above, we have only two pivots (in the $1$st and $2$nd columns). To transform the matrix to reduced row echelon form, we need to create zeros above the pivots only. This gives,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+3{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -7 & -14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422480 1058 #edb/ref 17592186422482 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422480 1062 #uuid "06ed1b32-abf8-5d02-b409-e83aa1a9bf69" 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422480 1063 #edb/ref 17592186422479 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422481 1058 #edb/ref 17592186422483 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422481 1062 #uuid "1f437206-fa08-5382-b319-4b882827b9a2" 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422481 1063 #edb/ref 17592186097174 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422482 1058 #edb/ref 17592186422484 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422482 1062 #uuid "6862e7b5-f79b-5b64-a612-6d85862752ef" 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422482 1063 #edb/ref 17592186266102 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422483 1058 #edb/ref 17592186422480 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422483 1062 #uuid "6e7d6a76-cc67-5b59-8e1b-d53698eacff0" 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422483 1063 #edb/ref 17592186342242 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422484 1062 #uuid "9f34ebb7-b2e8-595a-840d-d43ea1cd168d" 13194139534456 17592186045417 true] [17592186422484 1063 #edb/ref 17592186422478 13194139534456 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-fda0e0b8-3081-5e52-8593-c6700e3052bb" 17592186422465 "answer-0a7564c8-04d6-57a1-9a06-28d7b8421a35" 17592186422466 "answer-0ee5bd89-c4e9-5aea-ba6a-3f045af5c0e6" 17592186422467 "answer-3c1f7437-d98a-5bd7-97a0-2e5ff4f2f649" 17592186422468 "answer-41cef48b-98a3-54bd-b406-d5e167d64ae9" 17592186422469 "answer-45df3fe7-8c4e-5624-afa2-3e1ab32743c2" 17592186422470 "answer-75130a5b-9607-5217-b80c-6757c94daf70" 17592186422471 "answer-8076b85b-1614-5135-bb4c-2ab5d41377da" 17592186422472 "answer-d64479b7-f216-5594-be33-53f9d09c2c72" 17592186422473 "answer-d82b73e6-0a25-5302-99e8-b157a818667e" 17592186422474 "answer-f1ebe9c7-57ca-